WEBVTT

00:12.880 --> 00:14.880
<b>[slow footsteps approaching]</b>

00:21.470 --> 00:24.640
<b>[Daimyo, in rasping voice]
It is out there, mewling,</b>

00:24.730 --> 00:26.440
<b>grasping to be born.</b>

00:27.270 --> 00:29.190
<b>You speak of the rising power.</b>

00:29.820 --> 00:32.280
<b>[Daimyo] I have long
feasted upon this land.</b>

00:32.360 --> 00:36.490
<b>It has sustained me.
But it has also become a prison.</b>

00:36.570 --> 00:38.200
<b>A moldering tomb.</b>

00:38.780 --> 00:41.240
<b>I have waited for a power such as this.</b>

00:41.330 --> 00:45.460
<b>The world seeks balance.
A force to oppose my own was inevitable.</b>

00:46.040 --> 00:48.210
<b>It is meant to be my reckoning.</b>

00:49.090 --> 00:52.550
<b>It may instead be my salvation.</b>

00:52.630 --> 00:56.050
<b>You will find the source
of this power and bring them to me.</b>

00:56.130 --> 00:58.550
<b>My lady, I will not fail you.</b>

00:58.640 --> 01:01.260
<b>-[Daimyo] No, you will not.
-[squelching]</b>

01:01.350 --> 01:03.430
<b>I intend to ensure it.</b>

01:04.390 --> 01:06.440
<b>[swooshing]</b>

01:08.900 --> 01:10.900
<b>[screaming]</b>

01:11.780 --> 01:15.450
<b>[deep, guttural groan]</b>

01:17.780 --> 01:19.570
<b>["Black Gold"
by Flying Lotus plays]</b>

01:19.660 --> 01:23.240
<b>♪ Brought in a world ♪</b>

01:23.910 --> 01:29.420
<b>♪ World so brand new
Endless possibilities ♪</b>

01:30.710 --> 01:34.590
<b>♪ A whole new identity ♪</b>

01:35.090 --> 01:37.340
<b>♪ Can't you see? ♪</b>

01:38.090 --> 01:41.930
<b>♪ Black gold of the sun ♪</b>

01:42.010 --> 01:44.680
<b>♪ Open up your eyes ♪</b>

01:44.770 --> 01:47.350
<b>♪ Open up your heart ♪</b>

01:47.440 --> 01:50.270
<b>♪ And feel the sunshine ♪</b>

01:50.360 --> 01:52.690
<b>♪ Black diamond ♪</b>

01:53.190 --> 01:55.860
<b>♪ I just want to be ♪</b>

01:55.940 --> 01:58.610
<b>♪ Where I'm supposed to be ♪</b>

01:59.660 --> 02:02.280
<b>♪ And that's right here with you ♪</b>

02:14.170 --> 02:18.880
<b>♪ Don't mistake my kindness for weakness ♪</b>

02:18.970 --> 02:21.640
<b>♪ 'Cause I'm strong, you see ♪</b>

02:21.720 --> 02:24.680
<b>♪ Stronger than you'll ever be ♪</b>

02:26.640 --> 02:29.060
<b>♪ Loyal to me ♪</b>

02:29.140 --> 02:31.980
<b>♪ Someone to call my friend ♪</b>

02:32.060 --> 02:34.900
<b>♪ Whenever you need me ♪</b>

02:34.980 --> 02:37.740
<b>♪ I'll be right here ♪</b>

02:37.820 --> 02:40.110
<b>♪ Love and loyalty ♪</b>

02:40.610 --> 02:43.200
<b>♪ Trust and honesty ♪</b>

02:44.330 --> 02:46.830
<b>♪ I'll never let go ♪</b>

03:00.510 --> 03:02.010
<b>[slow, steady drip]</b>

03:06.100 --> 03:07.680
<b>[groans lightly]</b>

03:08.730 --> 03:09.560
<b>[grunts]</b>

03:14.310 --> 03:16.480
<b>[gasps sharply, sighs]</b>

03:17.570 --> 03:18.400
<b>[exhales]</b>

03:19.740 --> 03:21.740
<b>-[gentle sloshing]
-Huh?</b>

03:23.820 --> 03:24.910
<b>[loud splash]</b>

03:27.080 --> 03:28.870
<b>Sorry, you startled me.</b>

03:28.950 --> 03:30.330
<b>Same.</b>

03:30.960 --> 03:32.460
<b>Why are you wearing that?</b>

03:32.540 --> 03:34.380
<b>What-- Where did-- What are you--?</b>

03:34.880 --> 03:36.000
<b>[sighs]</b>

03:36.090 --> 03:40.510
<b>You were sleeping the whole day.
I kind of got bored.</b>

03:44.510 --> 03:46.140
<b>I'm sorry I touched your stuff.</b>

03:48.470 --> 03:50.430
<b>And wore your helmet.</b>

03:50.930 --> 03:52.940
<b>And poured water all over you.</b>

03:53.480 --> 03:55.100
<b>Are you mad at me?</b>

03:55.190 --> 03:57.400
<b>[Yasuke] Do you not realize
what you've done?</b>

03:59.480 --> 04:00.900
<b>You saved my life.</b>

04:00.990 --> 04:03.490
<b>I owe you the greatest possible debt.</b>

04:04.240 --> 04:07.410
<b>Well, I'm glad you're not mad!
And also still alive.</b>

04:09.990 --> 04:12.830
<b>The preacher. I saw him hurt you.</b>

04:13.460 --> 04:14.670
<b>Are you all right?</b>

04:14.750 --> 04:18.920
<b>I'm okay, now that he's… gone.</b>

04:19.000 --> 04:21.420
<b>-[Yasuke] And your illness?
-[gasps softly]</b>

04:23.630 --> 04:26.220
<b>Hey! What are these?</b>

04:26.720 --> 04:28.430
<b>They look like fancy shoes.</b>

04:28.510 --> 04:30.890
<b>Uh-- Well, they're for horses.</b>

04:30.970 --> 04:34.060
<b>This is a pretty fan. Were you a dancer?</b>

04:34.640 --> 04:37.150
<b>A particular kind of dancer. Yes.</b>

04:41.780 --> 04:42.820
<b>[Saki] Wow.</b>

04:43.440 --> 04:44.450
<b>[chuckles]</b>

04:44.530 --> 04:48.070
<b>That is not for you to touch.
Put it down. Nothing here is.</b>

04:50.410 --> 04:53.750
<b>Listen, this village
is no longer safe for you.</b>

04:54.250 --> 04:56.080
<b>The people have seen your abilities.</b>

04:56.170 --> 04:58.960
<b>Now you need to go
somewhere far, far away from here.</b>

04:59.460 --> 05:01.050
<b>I am going somewhere far.</b>

05:01.130 --> 05:04.170
<b>You're taking me up the river
to see the doctor, remember?</b>

05:05.170 --> 05:06.010
<b>No.</b>

05:07.090 --> 05:11.060
<b>Our fight with the preacher and his goons
will have caught the Daimyo's attention.</b>

05:11.140 --> 05:14.060
<b>They'll have soldiers
patrolling the river in force.</b>

05:14.140 --> 05:15.810
<b>But you promised my mo--</b>

05:15.890 --> 05:19.110
<b>-You promised Ichika.
-I will take you somewhere safe.</b>

05:19.190 --> 05:21.900
<b>Your only chance is to stay hidden.</b>

05:21.980 --> 05:23.650
<b>Keep to the outskirts.</b>

05:23.740 --> 05:26.740
<b>It won't be much of a life,
but it will be a life.</b>

05:26.820 --> 05:28.490
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

05:29.200 --> 05:30.870
<b>-[gasps]
-[objects clattering]</b>

05:32.330 --> 05:33.450
<b>Huh?</b>

05:34.330 --> 05:36.460
<b>[alarming, ethereal music plays]</b>

05:36.540 --> 05:40.920
<b>[raising voice] Didn't you just say,
"I owe you the greatest possible debt"?</b>

05:41.500 --> 05:44.760
<b>You're going to take me up the river.
That's final!</b>

05:45.720 --> 05:47.180
<b>[gasps, grunts]</b>

05:49.470 --> 05:50.300
<b>Stop!</b>

05:50.390 --> 05:54.310
<b>We're going up the river,
and we're going to see Doctor Morisuke!</b>

05:55.100 --> 05:56.060
<b>Morisuke?</b>

05:56.730 --> 05:57.940
<b>-[thud]
-Ah!</b>

05:58.900 --> 06:00.440
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

06:03.780 --> 06:05.070
<b>Lieutenant Kurosaka.</b>

06:05.150 --> 06:07.450
<b>A deserved end for any priest.</b>

06:07.530 --> 06:11.530
<b>Whoever wields the power our lady sensed,
they passed through here.</b>

06:12.330 --> 06:13.580
<b>We're getting close.</b>

06:14.330 --> 06:18.160
<b>-[man] What do we do with this place?
-[Kurosaka] Burn it to the ground.</b>

06:18.790 --> 06:20.000
<b>[gulping]</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:24.300
<b>Ichika knew what you could do
when she rescued you from the preacher.</b>

06:24.380 --> 06:27.800
<b>She knew your sickness was a side effect
of your powers manifesting.</b>

06:27.880 --> 06:28.720
<b>[Saki] Hmm.</b>

06:28.800 --> 06:32.350
<b>And she wouldn't take you
to see any other doctor, only Morisuke.</b>

06:32.430 --> 06:34.970
<b>She said he was
the only one who could help.</b>

06:35.470 --> 06:38.980
<b>Ichika wasn't taking you to be healed.
She was taking you to be trained.</b>

06:39.060 --> 06:40.730
<b>[gasps] Huh?</b>

06:41.440 --> 06:42.900
<b>I knew Morisuke.</b>

06:42.980 --> 06:44.110
<b>In another time.</b>

06:44.690 --> 06:48.490
<b>He was a brave warrior.
One with abilities like yours.</b>

06:48.570 --> 06:50.990
<b>"The Doctor" is a name
he earned in battle.</b>

06:51.070 --> 06:53.910
<b>He attacked with a surgeon's precision.</b>

06:56.370 --> 07:00.290
<b>You row boats.
How would you know a warrior like that?</b>

07:00.830 --> 07:03.250
<b>Wait, how would Ichika know?</b>

07:03.330 --> 07:06.750
<b>[Yasuke] Mm. Seems your guardian had
secrets of her own.</b>

07:07.590 --> 07:10.010
<b>Another thing she shares
with a woman I once knew.</b>

07:11.180 --> 07:14.680
<b>[Saki] Yassan, do you think that Ichika…</b>

07:15.260 --> 07:17.640
<b>Do you really think that she's--?</b>

07:17.720 --> 07:21.520
<b>I don't know. All we can do now
is act as she would have wanted.</b>

07:23.940 --> 07:26.770
<b>Does that mean
you'll take me up the river?</b>

07:27.280 --> 07:30.150
<b>No, I told you,
the river is too dangerous.</b>

07:30.950 --> 07:32.660
<b>We travel to Morisuke by land.</b>

07:32.740 --> 07:34.240
<b>[gasps, chuckles]</b>

07:52.010 --> 07:53.930
<b>[rasping]</b>

07:56.010 --> 07:56.890
<b>Ready.</b>

08:01.230 --> 08:02.190
<b>Wow.</b>

08:02.270 --> 08:04.440
<b>You have an actual face.</b>

08:05.270 --> 08:06.900
<b>It looks weird.</b>

08:07.400 --> 08:09.280
<b>[Yasuke] You're wearing her necklace.</b>

08:10.740 --> 08:13.070
<b>It's… to remember.</b>

08:17.580 --> 08:18.490
<b>Let's go.</b>

08:32.970 --> 08:34.880
<b>-[clattering]
-[soft thud]</b>

08:34.970 --> 08:36.510
<b>[gentle, melodic music plays]</b>

08:49.860 --> 08:51.820
<b>Saki, we must keep moving.</b>

08:51.900 --> 08:52.990
<b>I know.</b>

08:53.070 --> 08:56.320
<b>I just… didn't get to say goodbye</b>

08:56.950 --> 08:57.950
<b>to Ichiro.</b>

08:58.030 --> 08:59.700
<b>He knows how you feel.</b>

09:00.280 --> 09:03.410
<b>Trust me.
He knows you would never want to hurt him.</b>

09:04.120 --> 09:05.210
<b>[sighs softly]</b>

09:11.420 --> 09:13.130
<b>[man] Saki? Saki!</b>

09:13.710 --> 09:15.800
<b>Where is the demon girl?</b>

09:15.880 --> 09:18.140
<b>Look what she's done to my boy!</b>

09:18.220 --> 09:20.930
<b>Saki, the singer's daughter?</b>

09:21.430 --> 09:24.560
<b>I saw her fighting
with a robot and a wolf woman.</b>

09:24.640 --> 09:27.690
<b>She has abilities. Inhuman ones.</b>

09:27.770 --> 09:30.650
<b>I don't care what she is. She hurt my son!</b>

09:30.730 --> 09:32.900
<b>[murmuring]</b>

09:34.320 --> 09:37.150
<b>-What happened to the boy?
-Who are you?</b>

09:37.740 --> 09:40.320
<b>More important for you is who we serve.</b>

09:40.830 --> 09:45.410
<b>You will show us respect befitting
the emissaries of your land's Daimyo.</b>

09:45.500 --> 09:48.670
<b>"Emissaries"? You mean, hired thugs.</b>

09:52.340 --> 09:54.340
<b>-[gasps, grunts]
-[villagers gasp]</b>

09:54.420 --> 09:56.550
<b>-[Kurosaka] What happened?
-[gasps]</b>

09:56.630 --> 09:59.090
<b>He-- He was attacked by a girl.</b>

09:59.800 --> 10:02.810
<b>She made him fly 50 feet
without touching him.</b>

10:02.890 --> 10:05.850
<b>You can ask the kids. They saw.</b>

10:05.930 --> 10:08.020
<b>Tell me about this girl.</b>

10:09.900 --> 10:11.310
<b>[grunts]</b>

10:12.060 --> 10:13.070
<b>-[Yasuke sighs]
-Ugh.</b>

10:13.150 --> 10:15.400
<b>I just tripped on another branch.</b>

10:15.480 --> 10:17.190
<b>I thought you were psychic.</b>

10:17.280 --> 10:20.570
<b>That's not how it works.
Why can't we just take the road?</b>

10:20.660 --> 10:22.330
<b>It'd be so much easier.</b>

10:22.410 --> 10:24.240
<b>Look, it's right there.</b>

10:29.670 --> 10:30.670
<b>We go deeper.</b>

10:31.790 --> 10:34.630
<b>-[crickets chirping]
-[fire crackling softly]</b>

10:36.800 --> 10:38.590
<b>[gentle music plays]</b>

10:41.050 --> 10:43.470
<b>[quiet clinking]</b>

10:59.070 --> 11:01.070
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

11:24.260 --> 11:27.010
<b>Yassan! Yassan!
Is that where the doctor lives?</b>

11:27.100 --> 11:30.270
<b>No, we have another day's journey
ahead of us yet.</b>

11:30.350 --> 11:32.520
<b>-[woman yells] Help!
-[Saki gasps]</b>

11:35.110 --> 11:37.780
<b>I swear. I haven't seen them.</b>

11:41.360 --> 11:43.700
<b>-[grunts]
-[groans]</b>

11:43.780 --> 11:46.200
<b>[armored man]
They were seen headed this way.</b>

11:46.280 --> 11:48.290
<b>They must have passed through here.</b>

11:48.370 --> 11:52.920
<b>Hard to miss a giant, black-skinned man
traveling with a little girl.</b>

11:53.000 --> 11:55.420
<b>[old man] There's been
no one like that here.</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:56.340
<b>[woman gasps]</b>

11:56.420 --> 11:59.960
<b>Do what you want with me.
Just let my wife go.</b>

12:00.050 --> 12:03.050
<b>[armored man] Her fate is in your hands.</b>

12:03.130 --> 12:04.050
<b>Speak!</b>

12:04.140 --> 12:06.720
<b>[old man] No. Please, no!</b>

12:07.680 --> 12:12.270
<b>-You'd only be trading your life for hers.
-She's going to die because of us.</b>

12:14.190 --> 12:15.980
<b>Your choice is made.</b>

12:17.570 --> 12:19.730
<b>-[trembling breaths]
-[Saki] Do something!</b>

12:22.530 --> 12:23.900
<b>-[grunts]
-[swords clashing]</b>

12:25.570 --> 12:26.990
<b>Any time now.</b>

12:32.250 --> 12:33.830
<b>The black-skinned giant.</b>

12:34.330 --> 12:35.880
<b>Where's the girl?</b>

12:35.960 --> 12:37.500
<b>[Yasuke] Far from here.</b>

12:37.590 --> 12:40.960
<b>I hope for your sake
you fight better than you lie.</b>

12:41.460 --> 12:44.260
<b>[overlapping grunts]</b>

12:50.560 --> 12:51.430
<b>[choked grunt]</b>

12:52.560 --> 12:53.480
<b>[gasps softly]</b>

12:56.150 --> 12:57.060
<b>[yells]</b>

13:00.900 --> 13:02.190
<b>[armored man] Giant!</b>

13:03.900 --> 13:06.990
<b>Drop your weapon and turn slowly.</b>

13:16.500 --> 13:17.420
<b>[woman gasps]</b>

13:18.630 --> 13:20.630
<b>[panting]</b>

13:22.800 --> 13:23.920
<b>[grunts]</b>

13:24.920 --> 13:26.430
<b>[breathing heavily]</b>

13:28.510 --> 13:31.310
<b>[laughing]</b>

13:31.390 --> 13:34.140
<b>You did me a favor, getting rid of my men.</b>

13:38.770 --> 13:42.190
<b>It was the end of the month,
and they'd be looking to get paid.</b>

13:42.270 --> 13:44.320
<b>Saved me a fortune in salaries.</b>

13:44.400 --> 13:47.450
<b>Whatever you were paying them,
it was too much.</b>

13:47.530 --> 13:50.450
<b>[Kurosaka] Big words
for a man who is barely standing.</b>

13:50.530 --> 13:52.660
<b>Still, you did show skill.</b>

13:52.740 --> 13:56.330
<b>It seems our young prodigy
has a warrior as her protector.</b>

13:56.410 --> 14:00.130
<b>[Yasuke] Theirs was the first blood
to touch this blade in many years.</b>

14:00.210 --> 14:03.210
<b>You can do us both a favor
and let it be the last.</b>

14:04.170 --> 14:07.340
<b>I hear the pain in your voice
behind those strained threats.</b>

14:07.420 --> 14:11.470
<b>The pain of an outcast,
forever marked by their skin.</b>

14:11.550 --> 14:15.930
<b>No matter how skilled in battle
or honorable you proved yourself.</b>

14:16.020 --> 14:17.100
<b>I've felt it too.</b>

14:17.180 --> 14:20.730
<b>The dull-eyed masses' hatred
of anything they don't understand.</b>

14:20.810 --> 14:24.230
<b>But unlike you, I embraced my pain.</b>

14:24.730 --> 14:26.400
<b>Forged it into a weapon.</b>

14:26.490 --> 14:28.740
<b>[groans, retches]</b>

14:31.320 --> 14:32.580
<b>[metallic scrape]</b>

14:34.620 --> 14:35.580
<b>[retches]</b>

14:40.830 --> 14:45.130
<b>You know, you could just tie a blade
to a stick. It's probably a lot easier.</b>

14:45.210 --> 14:47.420
<b>[upbeat music playing]</b>

14:48.090 --> 14:51.050
<b>[both grunting]</b>

14:57.060 --> 14:59.100
<b>[Yasuke] Saki! Run!</b>

14:59.180 --> 15:01.190
<b>[swords clashing in distance]</b>

15:08.820 --> 15:11.740
<b>[Kurosaka]
A tactical sacrifice to gain ground.</b>

15:11.820 --> 15:15.740
<b>So not just a warrior then,
but a commander?</b>

15:17.410 --> 15:19.200
<b>[both grunting]</b>

15:22.540 --> 15:23.710
<b>[Kurosaka grunts]</b>

15:25.920 --> 15:27.710
<b>[groans]</b>

15:27.800 --> 15:30.220
<b>[growls]</b>

15:33.760 --> 15:35.100
<b>[Yasuke shouts]</b>

15:37.810 --> 15:39.100
<b>[panting]</b>

15:39.180 --> 15:41.350
<b>Tactical sacrifice. [scoffs]</b>

15:41.980 --> 15:42.850
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:48.820 --> 15:50.780
<b>[both grunting]</b>

15:50.860 --> 15:51.900
<b>[splintering]</b>

15:53.610 --> 15:54.780
<b>[resounding crash]</b>

16:00.370 --> 16:02.370
<b>[grunting]</b>

16:03.460 --> 16:04.380
<b>[clang]</b>

16:05.630 --> 16:06.460
<b>[grunts]</b>

16:09.760 --> 16:10.880
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

16:11.800 --> 16:13.800
<b>[muffled crashing]</b>

16:16.930 --> 16:18.760
<b>[panting]</b>

16:20.180 --> 16:21.230
<b>[swords clash]</b>

16:23.190 --> 16:24.480
<b>-[gasps]
-[grunts]</b>

16:25.900 --> 16:27.690
<b>[both straining]</b>

16:27.770 --> 16:29.900
<b>Your sword is breaking.</b>

16:30.440 --> 16:31.820
<b>As is your body.</b>

16:37.410 --> 16:38.660
<b>[Kurosaka straining]</b>

16:43.830 --> 16:44.920
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

17:03.600 --> 17:05.850
<b>-[footsteps approaching]
-[groaning weakly]</b>

17:07.770 --> 17:08.770
<b>[Kurosaka sighs]</b>

17:09.770 --> 17:12.570
<b>I'll tell the girl
you made a heroic effort.</b>

17:13.190 --> 17:16.700
<b>It may give her some comfort
before the end.</b>

17:22.290 --> 17:23.200
<b>[Kurosaka grunts]</b>

17:23.790 --> 17:24.830
<b>[gasping]</b>

17:40.050 --> 17:41.560
<b>Not all.</b>

17:46.850 --> 17:49.350
<b>[groaning]</b>

17:52.400 --> 17:54.110
<b>-[grunts]
-[shimmering sound]</b>

17:56.200 --> 17:57.610
<b>[sighs, gasps]</b>

18:02.990 --> 18:07.460
<b>You're as powerful
as my lady said you would be, Saki.</b>

18:08.460 --> 18:09.790
<b>-[grunts]
-[gasps]</b>

18:09.880 --> 18:10.880
<b>[clattering]</b>

18:18.340 --> 18:19.340
<b>[Yasuke groaning]</b>

18:21.930 --> 18:23.140
<b>I told you to run.</b>

18:23.680 --> 18:26.600
<b>And you thought
I was gonna start listening to you?</b>

18:27.180 --> 18:28.190
<b>[scoffs]</b>

18:30.560 --> 18:31.690
<b>I'm sorry, Saki.</b>

18:32.310 --> 18:35.230
<b>I've failed. I meant to protect you
from people like her,</b>

18:35.320 --> 18:36.990
<b>but… I couldn't.</b>

18:37.070 --> 18:39.200
<b>Instead, you had to save me again.</b>

18:39.700 --> 18:42.030
<b>In case you haven't noticed,</b>

18:42.120 --> 18:43.950
<b>I have, like</b>

18:44.580 --> 18:46.580
<b>crazy mind superpowers.</b>

18:47.200 --> 18:49.460
<b>I don't need anyone to protect me.</b>

18:49.540 --> 18:52.080
<b>Then why did you insist
that I travel with you?</b>

18:52.170 --> 18:53.880
<b>So I wouldn't be alone.</b>

18:53.960 --> 18:57.260
<b>We can face anything
as long as we don't do it alone.</b>

18:57.340 --> 18:59.130
<b>Ichika used to say that to me.</b>

18:59.220 --> 19:01.890
<b>Mmm. Yeah, Ichika taught you well.</b>

19:04.470 --> 19:06.890
<b>She would be proud of you today, Saki.</b>

19:06.970 --> 19:08.600
<b>She is proud.</b>

19:09.810 --> 19:10.640
<b>You think so?</b>

19:11.600 --> 19:12.650
<b>Mmm.</b>

19:14.110 --> 19:16.530
<b>You're still going
to let me protect you, though.</b>

19:16.610 --> 19:18.650
<b>[Saki] How about we protect each other?</b>

19:19.570 --> 19:22.030
<b>[Yasuke] Did Ichika teach you
how to bargain too?</b>

19:29.250 --> 19:32.080
<b>-[indistinct light chatter]
-[man] Have you heard?</b>

19:38.260 --> 19:41.510
<b>-[man] The war has nothing to do with us.
-[man 2] I don't wanna die.</b>

19:42.180 --> 19:43.300
<b>[man 3] I heard.</b>

19:44.010 --> 19:45.930
<b>[man 4] It's not safe here anymore!</b>

19:46.010 --> 19:47.930
<b>[overlapping light chatter]</b>

19:48.930 --> 19:50.430
<b>[inquisitive murmurs]</b>

19:50.520 --> 19:52.440
<b>-[man] What?
-[patrons whispering]</b>

19:52.520 --> 19:53.440
<b>Who's that?</b>

19:54.520 --> 19:55.440
<b>Huh?</b>

19:55.520 --> 19:58.440
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

19:59.690 --> 20:01.610
<b>[Yasuke] Perhaps you can help us?</b>

20:01.700 --> 20:04.700
<b>We've come to town
in search of a doctor, Morisuke.</b>

20:04.780 --> 20:08.040
<b>Uh, I'm sorry.
There's no doctor here by that name.</b>

20:08.540 --> 20:11.290
<b>I see. Thank you anyway.</b>

20:12.660 --> 20:14.710
<b>[Saki] So, what do we do now?</b>

20:14.790 --> 20:15.790
<b>Mmm.</b>

20:15.880 --> 20:17.670
<b>We have some tea.</b>

20:22.800 --> 20:26.350
<b>We're just sitting here.
Shouldn't we be trying to find the doctor?</b>

20:26.430 --> 20:27.850
<b>[Yasuke] He's found us.</b>

20:30.060 --> 20:31.770
<b>Ah. Welcome.</b>

20:31.850 --> 20:32.810
<b>Huh?</b>

20:42.740 --> 20:45.610
<b>[overlapping grunts]</b>

20:45.700 --> 20:48.780
<b>-[Saki stifling laughter]
-Took you long enough to show up.</b>

20:50.660 --> 20:54.210
<b>Saki, meet the doctor, Morisuke.</b>

20:54.830 --> 20:56.580
<b>Yasuke. [chuckles]</b>

20:56.670 --> 20:59.500
<b>The legendary Black Samurai himself.</b>

20:59.590 --> 21:02.170
<b>Wait, you're a samurai?</b>

21:02.260 --> 21:04.590
<b>Did you wear
one of those freaky mask things?</b>

21:04.680 --> 21:09.350
<b>Did you fight in the Daimyo Wars?
Did you ever see Oda Nobunaga in person?</b>

21:09.430 --> 21:11.100
<b>I am no samurai.</b>

21:11.640 --> 21:13.020
<b>Not in this life, child.</b>

21:13.100 --> 21:16.350
<b>It was not such a long life ago
as you think.</b>

21:16.980 --> 21:19.310
<b>The years lie heavy on your brow,</b>

21:19.900 --> 21:24.440
<b>but beneath them,
I see the proud warrior I fought beside.</b>

21:25.360 --> 21:29.990
<b>And clearly you still have your vigor
to be so recently a father.</b>

21:30.080 --> 21:31.410
<b>-She's not mine!
-He's not my dad!</b>

21:31.490 --> 21:33.040
<b>My mistake.</b>

21:33.750 --> 21:35.620
<b>What have you been doing, then?</b>

21:35.710 --> 21:39.880
<b>I recall that after Nobunaga fell,
you joined his son Nobutada</b>

21:39.960 --> 21:42.340
<b>to continue the Oda Clan's fight.</b>

21:42.420 --> 21:43.550
<b>And we lost.</b>

21:43.630 --> 21:45.300
<b>So did we all.</b>

21:45.380 --> 21:50.680
<b>I heard you'd been captured by the Akechi,
that they'd returned you to the Jesuits.</b>

21:50.760 --> 21:55.640
<b>But since you escaped from that bondage,
there's not been even a whisper of you.</b>

21:55.730 --> 21:57.440
<b>[Yasuke] I've been surviving.</b>

21:57.520 --> 21:59.190
<b>Keeping to my own concerns.</b>

21:59.770 --> 22:03.070
<b>I see.
Not all of us were given that choice.</b>

22:03.150 --> 22:07.200
<b>Here, we live in the darkest depths
of the Daimyo's shadow.</b>

22:07.860 --> 22:10.950
<b>Never knowing
when their soldiers will come for us.</b>

22:11.660 --> 22:14.950
<b>Everything we build, everything we earn,</b>

22:15.040 --> 22:17.830
<b>they take what they want
and destroy the rest.</b>

22:18.420 --> 22:24.090
<b>The only constants are fear and suffering,
but we resist where we can.</b>

22:24.170 --> 22:27.170
<b>I've gathered
these students to train in secret</b>

22:27.720 --> 22:31.090
<b>so they will be ready to lead
the rebellion when it begins.</b>

22:31.180 --> 22:34.720
<b>If you've left that fight behind,
then why have you come?</b>

22:35.310 --> 22:36.520
<b>The girl.</b>

22:36.600 --> 22:39.140
<b>She has powers stronger
than any I've witnessed.</b>

22:39.640 --> 22:40.600
<b>Even yours.</b>

22:41.190 --> 22:44.610
<b>[Morisuke] Well,
in that case, you have my thanks.</b>

22:44.690 --> 22:46.610
<b>[warbling sound]</b>

22:46.690 --> 22:47.740
<b>[both gasp softly]</b>

23:06.630 --> 23:08.170
<b>[Morisuke sighs in awe]</b>

23:08.260 --> 23:10.430
<b>[gentle melodic music plays]</b>

23:16.560 --> 23:20.140
<b>Then she truly is
the one we've waited for.</b>

23:20.230 --> 23:22.730
<b>The one who can deliver us victory.</b>

23:22.810 --> 23:24.480
<b>[feet shuffling]</b>

23:27.280 --> 23:28.400
<b>[inhales shakily]</b>

23:32.030 --> 23:34.950
<b>[Daimyo] Kurosaka, you come alone?</b>

23:35.620 --> 23:37.120
<b>[Kurosaka] It's as you said.</b>

23:37.910 --> 23:39.700
<b>Her abilities are great.</b>

23:39.790 --> 23:41.710
<b>The power you gave me was not--</b>

23:41.790 --> 23:43.080
<b>[groaning]</b>

23:44.710 --> 23:46.710
<b>[straining]</b>

23:48.710 --> 23:50.720
<b>[shouting]</b>

23:56.890 --> 23:58.640
<b>[grunts, sighs]</b>

23:59.810 --> 24:02.640
<b>[Daimyo] It seems I must resort
to more proven methods.</b>

24:08.360 --> 24:10.570
<b>[deep voice] I stand ready to serve.</b>

24:11.110 --> 24:13.030
<b>As you always have.</b>

24:13.110 --> 24:15.990
<b>You will serve your chosen purpose.</b>

24:16.070 --> 24:17.370
<b>And another.</b>

24:17.870 --> 24:20.870
<b>[Daimyo moaning]</b>

24:29.550 --> 24:31.970
<b>[Morisuke] You're certain
that this is your path?</b>

24:32.630 --> 24:35.550
<b>The man I knew
would have joined us without hesitation.</b>

24:36.140 --> 24:37.470
<b>Yasuke would have.</b>

24:38.010 --> 24:40.270
<b>Yassan seeks only the girl's safety.</b>

24:40.770 --> 24:43.020
<b>What's the heaviest thing
you've ever lifted?</b>

24:43.850 --> 24:46.980
<b>Well, there was
this big stone cross that--</b>

24:47.650 --> 24:49.440
<b>Hey Saki, can you do this?</b>

24:49.940 --> 24:51.690
<b>They let you play games here?</b>

24:51.780 --> 24:53.700
<b>[boy] What? Of course!</b>

24:53.780 --> 24:57.030
<b>The Daimyo will see
her very existence as a threat</b>

24:57.120 --> 24:58.660
<b>and seek to eliminate it.</b>

24:58.740 --> 25:01.410
<b>There is no true safety for her now.</b>

25:02.000 --> 25:05.040
<b>But her best chance
is to train here with us.</b>

25:05.120 --> 25:06.670
<b>-And fight back.
-[gasping]</b>

25:06.750 --> 25:08.750
<b>[children laughing]</b>

25:12.210 --> 25:16.180
<b>Injustice cannot be run from, Samurai.
It must be fought.</b>

25:17.510 --> 25:19.550
<b>Bringing only more injustice.</b>

25:20.430 --> 25:21.260
<b>[sighs]</b>

25:21.350 --> 25:22.850
<b>I have a boat to fix.</b>

25:34.030 --> 25:35.950
<b>-[armor clinking]
-Mmm.</b>

25:36.030 --> 25:36.860
<b>[swoosh]</b>

25:37.490 --> 25:38.950
<b>-Hmm? Hmm.
-Huh?</b>

25:39.530 --> 25:40.950
<b>[rustling]</b>

25:41.830 --> 25:42.950
<b>[both grunt softly]</b>

25:47.620 --> 25:49.630
<b>-[blows landing]
-[men grunting]</b>

25:52.130 --> 25:53.130
<b>The last time.</b>

26:02.010 --> 26:02.930
<b>[door creaking]</b>

26:07.060 --> 26:09.980
<b>[multiple footsteps approaching]</b>

26:12.820 --> 26:14.730
<b>[armor clinking]</b>

26:22.330 --> 26:24.490
<b>[upbeat, rhythmic music playing]</b>

26:24.580 --> 26:26.500
<b>Or second to last.</b>

26:27.830 --> 26:30.250
<b>["Between Memories"
by Flying Lotus plays]</b>

26:48.100 --> 26:49.730
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

26:49.810 --> 26:53.150
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

26:53.650 --> 26:55.780
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

26:55.860 --> 27:00.410
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

27:00.490 --> 27:03.870
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

27:04.370 --> 27:06.490
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

27:06.580 --> 27:10.960
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

27:11.460 --> 27:13.460
<b>[female vocalizing]</b>

27:16.460 --> 27:17.670
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

27:19.670 --> 27:22.180
<b>-[female vocalizing]
-♪ Come on ♪</b>

27:29.850 --> 27:31.730
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

27:31.810 --> 27:33.020
<b>♪ Come on ♪</b>

27:36.480 --> 27:38.490
<b>[girl laughing]</b>
